OL,3,GNEWSACould a new mayor break up a
OL,4,Apolice force?
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised over the
OL,7,Fimpact plans for a Thames Valley
OL,8,Fmayoral authority could have on
OL,9,Fpolicing.
OL,11,FMatthew Barber, Conservative police and
OL,12,Fcrime commissioner for the region, has
OL,13,Fwarned the move could lead to the
OL,14,Fcostly break-up of Thames Valley
OL,15,FPolice, as the proposed mayoral area
OL,16,Fdoes not match the force's boundaries.
OL,18,FLast month the government said it was
OL,19,Fin the final stages of agreeing a
OL,20,Fmayoral authority for the Thames Valley
OL,21,Fas part of 10 new devolution deals
OL,22,Facross England.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
