OL,3,GNEWSACould a new mayor break up a
OL,4,Apolice force?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupporters say mayors would empower
OL,7,Flocal areas, bring more money and
OL,8,Fcontrol over transport, housing and
OL,9,Fskills, and give people a single figure
OL,10,Fto hold to account.
